' walking speeds in 1/16 pixel a frame for speeds 1-3 (across / down);
' the boomerang flies twice as fast
data SpH bytes 23,42,56
data SpV bytes 11,21,28
data Bits bytes 1,2,4,8,16,32,64,128
' a stick bit for each facing (up, down, left, right)
data FaceBit bytes 1,2,4,8
data ManCol bytes 5,8
data BoomCol bytes 7,10
data StartX bytes 24,222
data StartY bytes 88,80

